        "faq_yfJE9Q": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you accept refunds?",
            "content": "<p>If you are not happy with your purchase, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:contact@easthealing.com\" title=\"mailto:contact@easthealing.com\">contact@easthealing.com </a>for our returns address. Please return the <strong>unopened and unused </strong>package within 30 days of receipt and we will issue a refund, minus the original shipping costs. You will also be responsible for the shipping costs to return the item.</p><p>Please read the information on allergies and side effects on our website, as we cannot offer a return and refund if side effects are experienced.<br/><br/>Please note that due to the delicate nature of our seeds, extra care must be taken when removing from their backing, otherwise they can dislodge from the adhesive. For issues with application, we recommend using the resources on our website or social channels. We do not accept returns and refunds for issues with application.<br/><br/>Finally, our ear seed kits are for educational use only. We are teaching you the points that are commonly associated with particular conditions but we can not and do not make claims to individual results if you experiment with auriculotherapy with ear seeds. Historically and in studies, with proper placement, ear seeds have been shown to work immediately for certain conditions, and take longer – up to a few weeks with multiple sessions – with others. Ear seeding is a holistic treatment that can support healing but they are not a magic pill. We therefore do not offer returns and refunds if you do not see results from ear seeds.</p>"
          }
        },
